        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Today I called Chez Soie Dentisterie to inform them that I have been dealing with a severe toothache for 5 days.  I asked if there was any way I could be seen today because the pain was so unbearable., They called me back 5 min later and told me they had an opening for me 1h30 later.  I could not believe how helpful and thoughtful they were and got me seen to so promptly….they were amazing 👍",
        "time": 1763421828,
        "translated": false
      },
