        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Thé appointment was for my little. All the staff was absolutely amazing in handling kids. They did a great job in examining her dental work. Super friendly Doctors. Highly recommend. Also my husband got his treatment here , we are very  satisfied. And my little ones are super excited and happy to receive a small gift as a toothbrush or toothpaste from the clinic 😊",
